                                <div><strong>Core Concept:</strong> "Friend with no judgment"</div>
                                <div><strong>Training Data:</strong> Psychology research and real-life events</div>
                                <div><strong>Response Style:</strong> Empathetic and logical, but friendly</div>
                                <div>
                                    <strong>Features:</strong>
                                    <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-gray-400">
                                        <li>• Learns a profile of each user</li>
                                        <li>• Aware of cultural and demographic differences</li>
                                        <li>• Detects a crisis and responds to it</li>
                                        <li>• Suggests resources that fit the conversation</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

