                                <span class="text-cy">API Integration:</span> ChatGPT-4 Turbo + University Gateways<br/>
                                <span class="text-cy">Data Storage:</span> Local encryption + secure transmission<br/>
                                <span class="text-cy">Healthcare APIs:</span> BetterHelp, NHS Crisis Line, 999<br/>
                                <span class="text-cy">Security:</span> 2FA + GDPR compliance + data anonymization
                            </div>
                        </div>
